Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), rustup, ca-certificates
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://petris.dev/psbox

Package: psbox
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus, systemd
Suggests: passt, xwayland-satellite
Description: Run Linux applications inside private-home sandboxes
 psbox runs applications in sandboxes with a private home, built on Linux
 namespaces, the new mount API, Landlock, seccomp, and cgroups. Each
 sandbox is supervised by a socket-activated systemd user service.
 .
 passt provides isolated sandbox networking, and xwayland-satellite runs
 X11 applications inside sandboxes.
